    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "Find the exact value of $\\cot\\theta$, given $\\operatorname{cosec}\\theta=-\\dfrac{5}{3}$ and $\\theta$ is in the third quadrant.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\dfrac{4}{3}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n1+\\cot^2\\theta&=\\operatorname{cosec}^2\\theta\\\\\n\\cot^2\\theta&=\\left(-\\frac{5}{3}\\right)^2-1\\\\\n\\cot^2\\theta&=\\frac{25}{9}-1\\\\\n\\cot^2\\theta&=\\frac{16}{9}.\n\\end{align*}$$\n\nIn the third quadrant, both $\\cos\\theta$ and $\\sin\\theta$ are negative, so $\\cot\\theta=\\dfrac{\\cos\\theta}{\\sin\\theta}>0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\n\\cot\\theta&=\\sqrt{\\frac{16}{9}}\\\\\n\\cot\\theta&=\\frac{4}{3}.\n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
